<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n6856" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Carpăthus</span></b>  (<b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">-ŏs</span></b> , <i><span class="en">Mel. 2, 7, 13</span></i>), i,
			f., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Κάρπαθος</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>an island in the
				Ægean Sea</i>, <i>between Crete and
				Rhodes</i>, now <i>Scarpanto</i>, <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 12,
				23, § 71</span></i>; <i><span class="en">5, 31, 36, §
			133</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			Deriv.: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Carpăthĭus</span></b> , a, um,
				adj., = <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Καρπάθιος</span>,
				<i>Carpathian</i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mare,</span>”
				<i>the sea named from Carpathus</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Mel.
					2, 7, 13</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Plin. 4, 12, 23, § 71</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Prop. 3</span></i>
			(4), 7, 12; <i><span class="en">Verg. A. 5, 595</span></i>; <i><span class="en">Hor. C. 4,
				5, 10</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">gurges,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					G. 4, 387</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">and pelagus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Hor.
					C. 1, 35, 8</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Col. 8, 16, 10</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">undae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Prop.
					2, 5, 11</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vates,</span>”
				i. e. <i>Proteus</i>, <i>who had his abode there</i>,
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 11, 249</span></i>
			; cf. Verg. l. l. and Serv.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">so also senex,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Am. 2, 15, 10</span></i>
			.</div>
